"}]},{"client_msg_id":"631d224e-e5eb-47ab-9e09-2d917fa066f5","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"逆のissueがあるので、やはりコンパイル結果でexit codeは変わりそう。\n\u003chttps://github.com/microsoft/TypeScript/issues/13280\u003e","ts":"1621240368.325400","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: tsc CLI: option to always exit with 0 exit code · Issue #13280 · microsoft/TypeScript","id":1,"title":"tsc CLI: option to always exit with 0 exit code · Issue #13280 · microsoft/TypeScript","title_link":"https://github.com/microsoft/TypeScript/issues/13280","text":"It would be nice if the tsc command had an option to always exit with a 0 exit code when there were compile errors. I want to run something in my script after compiling. Currently I have to do this...","image_url":"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/3f6f49c5e8b2c038d23900e0b11a0d89bbb596129f5e29961dedefbb7d1f6007/microsoft/TypeScript/issues/13280","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","from_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/TypeScript/issues/13280","original_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/TypeScript/issues/13280"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mUd"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bee75f5f-7b4e-46df-82f5-feb54f4a5018","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"あ、 `node typecheck.js` 噛ませてるせいかな","ts":"1621240362.325200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XTt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0708a3a3-5874-496d-a582-dcb97f2a8cfc","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"むむむ","ts":"1621240325.324900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eGxB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4b067811-70cc-4c8c-affe-dfe988b9f3b8","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"コンパイルエラーになったら exit code 1 になるはずですが","ts":"1621240263.324700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zUSq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4a12954c-917d-4006-83d5-e0231cfc67ad","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"esbuildと合わせて `tsc --noEmit` で型検査しようと思ってるんですが、これってエラーのときもexit codeが0になる仕様で合ってますか？\n失敗したかどうか取りたいときは文字列があるかどうかで判定することになるのかな","ts":"1621240009.323900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"G/jcv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9e52ad76-0f87-4d98-9965-a9cf858bf280","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"撤収します","ts":"1621178860.322600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Vzgu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"68611bb9-c829-4162-9bac-7cda1dc295c6","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"あれ、なんかチャンネル間違えてましたすみません","ts":"1621178844.322100","edited":{"user":"UERCTTT8B","ts":"1621178846.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"iinoyo","count":4,"users":["U78A6ESHM","U9S4G0LJW","UFHQ7TNT0","U01ATUT6PL3"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XTyK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"16114534-90a8-4260-a484-0d2b18662349","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"うーんこの","ts":"1621178817.321700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iqq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b895909b-19cc-4fa9-a88b-369bba75c5df","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"\u0026gt; Slack の場合は Event Subscriptions API というものがあり、Slack 上で特定のイベントがあるとSlack から特定の URI を叩くことができるようです。これがあれば、例えば特定のチャンネルで発言があるたびに Cloud Functions を叩かせたりすることができそうです。\n\u0026gt; \n\u0026gt; しかし、Discord の場合は Webhook でDiscord へとメッセージを送ることはできますが、Discord の方から何かを送る機能はなく、したがって Discord 上の発言に反応するためには常時プログラムでコネクションを貼っておく必要があります。ですから、実行時間に限りのある Cloud Functions では Discord の書き込みに反応することはできません。\n\u0026gt; \n\u0026gt; そこで適当なサーバー or コンテナでプログラムを常時動かし、Discord の書き込みを監視しつづける必要があります。今回は GCE 上でインスタンスを別途借りて監視プログラムを走らせることにしました。例えば VPC 外から Cloud Functions にアクセスできるようにするリスクを考えると、これは仕方のない決断かと思います。最小構成ではありますが、結局別のインスタンスが 24 時間走り続けることになりました。","ts":"1621178815.321500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"D9DCy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ad8c0a23-6cc4-405a-bb69-a3586e2e030c","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"自宅サーバに雑に置いてしまう…","ts":"1621178710.321200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ptza"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f12453e7-bf71-4a63-8734-9b2370f094a4","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"Go でバイナリ作って GCE に置くかなあ。","ts":"1621178174.320800","edited":{"user":"UERCTTT8B","ts":"1621178200.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DiH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4a1b862c-4399-4bcf-8911-f2aab5b97031","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"ちょっとやる気が失せてしまった。また今度元気なときに考えます","ts":"1621178156.320400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Vplg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5f9e9c96-69bb-4818-87ad-fc2a7853de2b","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"叩いた時に勝手に資源割り当てて起動するので便利的サムシングなので動かし続ける物は根本的に無理","ts":"1621178065.319800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CTtx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cafd9978-0639-467f-82db-f1a380032c1c","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"FaaSはまあbot向きではないですね","ts":"1621178032.319100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eqg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f7993192-a4a2-4dc7-88bf-4f0349fce907","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"WebSocket API なのでサーバーレスなアーキテクチャでは作れないという雑な理解をしています","ts":"1621178010.319000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"64i2L"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8adc98f7-63d5-42ed-9917-3b5d115817ba","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"なんか Cloud Functions 的なものでざっくり作れたら良いのではと思っていたが、どうも bot 的なものとは相性が悪いっぽい","ts":"1621177747.318100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aTCs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1ab362ed-1c21-40b3-bdc1-d69ca023ecb5","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"heroku でもいっかぁ","ts":"1621177727.317500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eB+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8641ad38-b04e-42b5-bbb4-b1f321a13067","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"随分前にTwitter bot作った時はherokuに投げたな、当時無料で動かせたので\n今はどうだろ","ts":"1621177706.317200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oTZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"84d3feca-526a-46db-970c-d6d4ab7b58b3","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"Discord bot ちょっと作ってみようかなと思ったんですけど、サーバー用意するのがちょっと面倒くさいですね","ts":"1621177666.316700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Y0c"}]}]
